---
import FigureViewport from './FigureViewport.astro';
import { createRequire } from 'node:module';
import { initialProfile, initialFormula, simulationConfig, frameInterval, endTime } from '../visuals/simulation-config.js';
const require = createRequire(`${process.cwd()}/package.json`);
const katex = createRequire(require.resolve('rehype-katex'))('katex');
const tex = (s: string) => katex.renderToString(s,{throwOnError:true});
const {mode='collision'} = Astro.props;
const collision=mode==='collision';
const id=`kdv-numerical-${mode}`;
const { n, length, dt } = simulationConfig;
const plotX = (x: number) => 62 + (x + length / 2) * 500 / length;
const path = Array.from({ length: n + 1 }, (_, j) => {
  const x = -length / 2 + j * length / n;
  const px = plotX(x);
  const py = 245 - initialProfile(x, mode) * 52;
  return `${j ? 'L' : 'M'}${px.toFixed(2)},${py.toFixed(2)}`;
}).join(' ');
const initial=initialFormula(mode);
---
<figure class="kdv-numerical" data-kdv-numerical={mode} aria-labelledby={`${id}-caption`}>
  <div class="simulation-heading">{collision?'2つのソリトンの衝突':'幅の広い波の分裂'}<span>数値シミュレーション</span></div>
  <div class="simulation-controls">
    <button type="button" data-sim-play disabled>Play</button>
    <button type="button" data-sim-reset disabled>Reset</button>
    <label>Speed <select data-sim-speed disabled aria-label="Playback speed"><option value=".5">0.5×</option><option value="1" selected>1×</option><option value="2">2×</option></select></label>
  </div>
  <label class="simulation-time" for={`${id}-time`}><span>Time <span set:html={tex('t')} /></span><output data-sim-time>0.00</output><input id={`${id}-time`} data-sim-seek type="range" min="0" max={endTime} step={frameInterval} value="0" disabled /></label>
  <FigureViewport width={640}><svg viewBox="0 0 600 330" role="img" aria-labelledby={`${id}-title ${id}-desc`}>
    <title id={`${id}-title`}>{collision?'Numerical KdV soliton collision':'Numerical KdV evolution of a broad pulse'}</title>
    <desc id={`${id}-desc`}>Solid curve: numerically evolved surface displacement eta. Dashed curve: initial profile. Time can be selected with the slider.</desc>
    <defs><clipPath id={`${id}-clip`}><rect x="62" y="42" width="500" height="225" /></clipPath></defs>
    <path d="M62 42 V267 M62 245 H562" stroke="var(--muted)" fill="none" stroke-width="1.2" />
    {[1,2,3].map(y=><path d={`M62 ${245-y*52} H562`} stroke="var(--line)" stroke-dasharray="3 5" />)}
    {[-length/2,0,length/2].map(x=><g><path d={`M${plotX(x)} 245 v5`} stroke="var(--muted)" /><foreignObject x={plotX(x)-40} y="270" width="80" height="55"><div class="simulation-tex" set:html={tex(String(x))} /></foreignObject></g>)}
    {[0,1,2,3].map(y=><foreignObject x="2" y={245-y*52-27.5} width="54" height="55"><div class="simulation-tex" set:html={tex(String(y))} /></foreignObject>)}
    <foreignObject x="0" y="-4" width="160" height="55"><div class="simulation-tex" set:html={tex('\\eta')} /></foreignObject>
    <foreignObject x="554" y="213" width="46" height="55"><div class="simulation-tex" set:html={tex('x')} /></foreignObject>
    <path d={path} data-sim-initial fill="none" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="3" stroke-dasharray="7 6" clip-path={`url(#${id}-clip)`} />
    <path d={path} data-sim-curve fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2.7" clip-path={`url(#${id}-clip)`} />
  </svg>
  <div class="simulation-legend"><span><i class="current"></i><span set:html={tex('\\text{numerical solution}')} /></span><span><i class="initial"></i><span set:html={tex('\\text{initial profile}')} /></span></div>
  </FigureViewport>
  <p data-sim-status class="simulation-status" role="status">Press Play to compute the evolution in your browser.</p>
  <figcaption id={`${id}-caption`}>{collision?'高い波が低い波に追いつく。衝突中の形と、離れた後の2つの波を、再生または時刻スライダーで比べてみよう。':'初めはなだらかな1つの波でも、時間を進めると高さと速さの異なる波に分かれていく。'} 破線は初期波形。</figcaption>
  <details class="simulation-method"><summary>Initial conditions and numerical method</summary>
    <p>本文のKdV方程式 <span set:html={tex('\\eta_t=(\\eta_{xxx}+6\\eta\\eta_x)/4')} /> を数値積分し、グラフには <span set:html={tex('\\eta')} /> を表示する。</p>
    <div class="simulation-initial-formula" set:html={tex(initial)} />
    {collision && <p>ここで <span set:html={tex('\\operatorname{sech}x=1/\\cosh x')} /> である。</p>}
    <p>周期区間 <span set:html={tex(`${-length/2}\\le x<${length/2}`)} /> を{n}点に分け、刻み幅 <span set:html={tex(`\\Delta t=${dt}`)} /> で <span set:html={tex(`0\\le t\\le ${endTime}`)} /> を計算する。空間微分はフーリエ法、時間発展は線形分散と非線形項のStrang分割を用いる。線形部分はフーリエ空間で厳密に進め、非線形部分は4次Runge–Kutta法で進める。高波数の混入を抑えるため、非線形積の計算では2/3則を用いる。</p>
    <p>実線は各時刻の数値解で、表示フレームの間隔は <span set:html={tex(String(frameInterval))} />。無限区間の厳密解を表示しているわけではない。周期境界では波が端を越えると反対側から戻るため、ここでは主要な波が端を越える前までを表示する。</p>
    <p data-sim-diagnostics>Invariant drift will be shown here after computation.</p>
    <p>分割法の参考：<a href="https://www.math.umd.edu/~tadmor/spectral_viscosity/Holden_et_al_KdV_splitting_JCP99.pdf">Holden, Karlsen &amp; Risebro (1999)</a>。</p>
  </details>
  <noscript><p>JavaScript is required for playback. The initial profile is shown above.</p></noscript>
</figure>
<style>
.kdv-numerical{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:1rem;margin:1.8rem 0;background:var(--paper)}
.simulation-heading{font-weight:600;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:baseline;gap:.3rem 1rem}.simulation-heading>span{font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted);font-weight:400}
.simulation-controls{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;margin:1rem 0 .6rem}.simulation-controls :is(button,select){font:inherit;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:.35rem .65rem;min-height:40px}.simulation-controls label{font-size:.85rem;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.3rem}.simulation-controls button:first-child{border-color:var(--accent);color:var(--accent);min-width:8em}.simulation-controls button{cursor:pointer}.simulation-controls :disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:default}
.simulation-time{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:.25rem .5rem;font-size:.9rem}.simulation-time>span{display:flex;gap:.3rem;align-items:baseline}.simulation-time output{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.simulation-time input{grid-column:1/-1;width:100%;accent-color:var(--accent);min-height:30px}
.kdv-numerical :is(button,select,input):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}
.kdv-numerical>svg{display:block;width:100%;max-width:600px;height:auto;margin:auto}.simulation-tex{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100%;font-size:16px;line-height:1;color:var(--ink);white-space:nowrap}
.simulation-legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:.4rem 1rem;font-size:14px}.simulation-legend>span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem}.simulation-legend i{display:block;width:25px;border-top:3px solid var(--accent)}.simulation-legend i.initial{border-top:3px dashed var(--muted)}
.simulation-status{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);min-height:1.8em;margin:.7rem 0}.kdv-numerical figcaption{font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted)}.simulation-method{margin-top:.8rem;font-size:.85rem}.simulation-initial-formula{max-width:100%;overflow-x:auto;padding:.5rem 0}
@media(max-width:480px){.kdv-numerical{padding:.7rem .35rem}.simulation-heading,.simulation-controls,.simulation-time,.simulation-status,.kdv-numerical figcaption,.simulation-method{margin-left:.25rem;margin-right:.25rem}.simulation-controls{gap:.4rem}.simulation-controls :is(button,select){font-size:.8rem;padding:.35rem .5rem}}
</style>
